{"articleNo":"3176","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=3176&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 제1회 도서관 퀴즈 이벤트(12.5 - 12.11까지)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.12.05","hit":"21287","attachments":[{"name":"도서관 퀴즈 이벤트 문제.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=3176&attachNo=22746"},{"name":"퀴즈이벤트 팜플렛.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=3176&attachNo=22747"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">퀴즈로 알아보는 도서관~~<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#003366\" size=\"5\">제1회 도서관 퀴즈 이벤트<br></font></span></h1>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"4\">&nbsp; <strong><font color=\"#003366\">ㅇ. 응모기간 : 2011. 12. 05(월) - 12. 11(일)(7일간)<br></font></strong></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#003366\" size=\"4\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ㅇ. 대&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 상 : 본교 학부 재학생<br></strong></font></span><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#003366\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></strong><font color=\"#003366\" size=\"4\"><strong>&nbsp;ㅇ. 응모함 및 용지비치 : 도서관 4곳<br></strong></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 도서관 1층 로비(1), 3층자료실(1), 5층 연속간행물실(1), 5층 전자정보실(1)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#003366\"><strong>ㅇ. 퀴즈문제 : 도서관 이용법에 관련된 6문제(첨부)&nbsp;<br></strong></font></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#003366\" size=\"4\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ㅇ. 정답자상품지급 : 20명<br></strong></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 상품권 만원권 5명, 칫솔 휴대용 살균기 5명, 도서 10명<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font><font size=\"3\">- 도서 : 우리들의 하느님. 그들이 말하지 않는 23가지, 기적의 사과<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;오래된 미래, 학문의 즐거움&nbsp; 2권씩</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#003366\" size=\"4\"><strong>ㅇ. 상품지급방법 : 기간 내 응모한 정답자 중 추첨하여 지급<br></strong></font></span></font><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#003366\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font size=\"4\">ㅇ. 추첨일시 : 2011. 12. 14(수) 15:00<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 추첨결과는 홈페이지에 공지하겠습니다.</font></strong></font></span></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
